@DocumentValidation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@DocumentValidation_ApiKey = substitua-por-chave-local

### Health (não exige autenticação)
GET {{DocumentValidation_HostAddress}}/api/validation/health
Accept: application/json

### Validar CNH pela API v1
POST {{DocumentValidation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/validation
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{DocumentValidation_ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: ide-http-client-cnh-001

{
  "documentType": "CNH",
  "policy": "CNH_DEFAULT",
  "idempotencyKey": "ide-http-client-cnh-001",
  "context": {
    "driverId": "demo-123"
  },
  "file": "<BASE64_DE_PDF_JPEG_OU_PNG>"
}

### Validar e persistir compliance de veículo
POST {{DocumentValidation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/validations
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{DocumentValidation_ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: ide-http-client-cipp-001

{
  "entityType": "VEHICLE",
  "entityId": "vehicle-123",
  "plate": "ABC-1D23",
  "documentType": "CIPP",
  "policy": "CIPP_DEFAULT",
  "idempotencyKey": "ide-cipp-vehicle-123-001",
  "fileName": "cipp.png",
  "file": "<BASE64_DE_PDF_JPEG_OU_PNG>"
}

### Consultar compliance sem reprocessar OCR
GET {{DocumentValidation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/compliance/VEHICLE/vehicle-123
X-API-Key: {{DocumentValidation_ApiKey}}

### Listar políticas (requer chave com papel admin)
GET {{DocumentValidation_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/catalog/policies
X-API-Key: {{DocumentValidation_ApiKey}}
